  titleEs: "Monitor de Se\xF1al sin Origen"
  titleEn: Unsourced Signal Monitor
  loreEs: "Monitor CRT industrial encendido sin cable de alimentaci\xF3n en un nicho
    del ala Oeste. Sus barras horizontales de interferencia barren la pantalla en
    un ciclo irregular sin fuente identificable."
  loreEn: Industrial CRT test monitor glowing without a power cord in a West wing
    niche. Irregular horizontal scan bars drift across its screen with no traceable
    broadcast source.
  accentColor: {r: 0.55, g: 0.84, b: 1, a: 1}
  inspectionScope: 0
